    "Ejemplo resuelto": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Example"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "El Dilo multiplataforma hecho en Tauri quedó congelado en 0.3.2 y sigue disponible para Intel, Windows y Linux. Esta es la versión nativa de Mac, y continúa la numeración.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The cross-platform Dilo built with Tauri is frozen at 0.3.2 and still available for Intel, Windows and Linux. This is the native Mac version, and it carries the numbering on."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "El general": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The default one"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "El general (%@)": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The default one (%@)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "El historial está apagado. Préndelo en Dictado para empezar a guardar lo que dictas.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "History is off. Turn it on in Dictation to start keeping what you dictate."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "El id tal cual lo muestra su consola.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The id exactly as their console shows it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "El marco alrededor de tus palabras es fijo. Es lo que evita que un dictado con forma de pregunta termine respondido.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The framing around your wording is fixed. It is what keeps a question-shaped dictation from being answered."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "El modelo de Apple corre en esta compu. Sin clave y sin internet.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple's model runs on this Mac. No key, no internet."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "El modelo devolvió las palabras tal cual. Eso es lo que pegaría una sesión real, así que puede que esta instrucción no pida nada que esta frase necesite.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The model gave the words back unchanged. That is what a real session would paste, so this instruction may not ask for anything this sentence needs."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "El que usan los modos que no eligieron uno propio.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The one used by modes that did not pick their own."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "El reconocimiento de voz no está disponible": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Speech recognition is unavailable"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "El reconocimiento, la lectura en voz alta y la transformación de texto corren en esta compu, con frameworks de Apple. Dilo no guarda audio. Sólo los modos con proveedor en línea mandan texto afuera, y la tarjeta siempre lo dice.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recognition, read aloud and text shaping all run on this Mac, with Apple frameworks. Dilo keeps no audio. Only modes with an online provider send text out, and the card always says so."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Elegido": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Selected"
          }
        }
