    "Dictar desde cualquier app": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dictar desde cualquier app"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dictate from any app"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mantén el gatillo mientras hablas y suéltalo para entregar el texto. Un toque corto deja el dictado encendido; otro toque lo termina. Esc cancela.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mantén el gatillo mientras hablas y suéltalo para entregar el texto. Un toque corto deja el dictado encendido; otro toque lo termina. Esc cancela."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hold the trigger while speaking and release it to deliver the text. A short tap keeps dictation on; tap again to finish. Esc cancels."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No pude cargar las novedades de esta versión. Puedes seguir usando Dilo.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No pude cargar las novedades de esta versión. Puedes seguir usando Dilo."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Could not load what’s new in this version. You can keep using Dilo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sin reescritura": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sin reescritura"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No rewrite"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Descargando %@… %lld%%": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Descargando %@… %lld%%"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Downloading %@… %lld%%"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "En pantallas sin notch": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "On displays without a notch"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "La píldora cuelga debajo de la barra de menús y no tapa tus íconos. El notch simulado se pega al borde de arriba, sobre el centro vacío de la barra, y se ve como el de un MacBook.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The pill hangs below the menu bar and never covers your icons. The simulated notch sits flush against the top edge, over the empty middle of the bar, and looks like a MacBook's."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Píldora bajo la barra": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pill below the bar"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Notch simulado": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Simulated notch"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "GPU": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "GPU"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Red": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Network"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Disco": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Disk"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cuánto trabaja la tarjeta gráfica, como lo mide Monitor de Actividad. Nada sale de acá.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "How hard the graphics card is working, as Activity Monitor measures it. Nothing leaves this Mac."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cuánto está bajando tu conexión ahora; al pasar el mouse, también lo que sube. Nada sale de acá.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "How fast your connection is downloading right now; hover to also see upload. Nothing leaves this Mac."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cuánto del disco de arranque está ocupado y cuánto queda libre. Nada sale de acá.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "How full your startup disk is and how much is left. Nothing leaves this Mac."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Avisos": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Alerts"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Avisar cerca del límite": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Warn near the limit"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cuando Codex o el plan de Claude pasan el 80 % y el 95 % de una ventana, la muesca se abre un momento a decírtelo. Una vez por umbral, y nunca mientras dictas.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When Codex or your Claude plan passes 80% and 95% of a window, the notch opens for a moment to tell you. Once per threshold, and never while you're dictating."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sube": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Up"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Libre": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Free"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@: %@ de la semana · se reinicia en %@": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@: %2$@ of the week · resets in %3$@"
          }
