    "Reunión": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Meeting"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Al pasar el mouse": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "On hover"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lo último que copias": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "What you last copied"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Junto a tus dictados, lo último que copiaste, para volver a copiarlo con un clic. Lo que un gestor de contraseñas marca como secreto no entra, y nada se guarda al cerrar Dilo.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Next to your dictations, what you last copied, so you can copy it again with one click. Anything a password manager marks as secret stays out, and nothing is kept when you quit Dilo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Próxima reunión": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Next meeting"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "La próxima reunión de tu calendario, y «Unirse» si trae un enlace de Zoom, Meet o Teams. Dilo te va a pedir permiso para leer el calendario.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The next meeting on your calendar, with “Join” when it has a Zoom, Meet or Teams link. Dilo will ask for permission to read your calendar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sin permiso para leer el calendario.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No permission to read your calendar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cambiar de modo": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Switch mode"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tus modos, para elegir con un clic cuál usa el atajo de siempre. «Normal» es el dictado limpio, sin IA.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your modes, to choose with one click which one your usual shortcut uses. “Normal” is plain dictation, no AI."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nota": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Note"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dictar una nota": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dictate a note"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nota · %@": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Note · %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nota guardada en Notas, carpeta Dilo.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Note saved in Notes, in the Dilo folder."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No pude guardar la nota en Notas ni copiarla.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I couldn't save the note in Notes or copy it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dilo no tiene permiso para usar Notas. Te copié la nota: pégala con ⌘V.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dilo isn't allowed to use Notes. I copied the note for you: paste it with ⌘V."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No pude guardar la nota en Notas. Te la copié: pégala con ⌘V.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I couldn't save the note in Notes. I copied it for you: paste it with ⌘V."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nota rápida": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quick note"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Un botón «Nota»: dictas y queda en Apple Notas, en la carpeta «Dilo», sin abrir ninguna app. Termínala con tu tecla de dictado. La primera vez macOS te pide permiso para que Dilo use Notas.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A “Note” button: you dictate and it lands in Apple Notes, in the “Dilo” folder, without opening any app. Finish it with your dictation key. The first time, macOS asks for permission for Dilo to use Notes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Guardar la nota": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Save the note"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Copiar": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Copy"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "version": "1.0"
